      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b>Pike Industrial Complex</b></p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;Here&#39;s some pointers on surviving this dangerous place.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">&nbsp;</p><ul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li>Types of Cards: Rats and Vats</li><li>Number of target cards: 4 rats</li><li>The Vats build up until a vat explosion occurs dealing damage per vat destroyed plus three.</li><li><span style=\"font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">The snowball of the vats is stealthy &amp; deadly. If a regen vat stays out, you may not even care if some cryogenic vats come out... Until an irradiated vat appears. Stuff of nightmares right there.</span></li></ul><ul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li>Dificulty rank - 3 (According to the wiki)</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>&nbsp;Villains with this environment</strong></p><ul style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><li>Thematically Plague Rat works well with this environment&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">His toxic mitigation makes the Pike Industrial vats a warm bath to him, &amp; his many separate instances of damage run away with the damage increase.</span></li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><strong>Heros with this environment</strong></p><ul><li style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><b>The Irradiated cyclohexane vat:&nbsp;</b> increases all damage dealt the boost is helpful to all heros, especially those that deal one and those that deal one and one. On the other hand it&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">changes all damage to toxic and this can mess up several heroes. Wraith, Absolute Zero, Ra.&nbsp;</span></li></ul><ul><li style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Heroes that reduce environment damage are essential here. (Wraith, Visionary)</li></ul><p style=\"margin: 0px 10px 20px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: 'Open Sans', HelveticaNeue, 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.3999996185303px; line-height: 21.5999984741211px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Anything I should add? Tips thoughts? Suggestions? Thanks for the help!</p>",
