    {
      "id": 142841,
      "name": "JJ Pearson",
      "username": "Mr.JJ",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mr.jj/{size}/5371_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-17T23:06:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Anything the changes damage type can screw over a ton of heroes, &amp; the toxic vat is no exception. Absolute Zero is fried, Ra's Solar Flare fizzles out, Wraith loses her targeting capabilities, etc.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The snowball of the vats is stealthy &amp; deadly. If a regen vat stays out, you may not even care if some cryogenic vats come out... Until an irradiated vat appears. Stuff of nightmares right there.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This environment is Plague Rat's element. His toxic mitigation makes the Pike Industrial vats a warm bath to him, &amp; his many separate instances of damage run away with the damage increase.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:20:09.033Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 1,
      "readers_count": 0,
      "score": 0.2,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 13155,
      "topic_slug": "a-survival-guide-to-pike-industrial-complex",
      "display_username": "JJ Pearson",
