      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-18T03:28:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Also, since much of Plague Rat's damage is Irreducible, he hits hard even through a Regen vat.</p><p>When fighting villains with many minions, Rats can be your friend in the early game.</p>",
