      "id": 142843,
      "name": "VisforYoshi",
      "username": "VisforYoshi",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/visforyoshi/{size}/2185_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-06-18T04:45:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Since this environment does a lot of small potshots, cards that reduce the environment damage (such as Mega Computer or MAss Levitation) work really well. GI bunker also works pretty nicley with this environment because if the villian has any DR, or the environment reduces damage in anyway, you can keep heros safe from the environment while assuring the villian still gets hit.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The cycohexline vat also works terribly with heros like Absolute zero, because all of his attacks rely on damage being a certain type. If it gets changed to toxic, he can no longer use any of said attackes</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:20:09.169Z",
